MintCurveConvexPosition::recoverERC20(address,uint256)
├── given caller is not owner and not authorized spender
│   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionUnauthorized
└── given caller is owner or authorized spender
    ├── when caller is authorized spender and not owner
    │   └── it should succeed and transfer tokens to owner
    ├── when token address is zero
    │   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionInvalidInput
    ├── when amount is zero
    │   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionInvalidInput
    ├── given amount exceeds the position token balance
    │   └── it should revert with ERC20InsufficientBalance
    └── given the position holds at least amount
        └── it should transfer amount to owner
